[6.3571, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.4744, "o", "Checking this Mac. This can take a minute.\r\n"]
[8.472, "o", "\r\nWhat I found\r\n  macOS 26.6.2 (arm64)\r\n  Homebrew: Homebrew 7.0.12\r\n  Installed with: install script (git checkout)\r\n  Owner of /opt/homebrew: admin\r\n  Files with a different owner: 0\r\n  People accounts on this Mac: 2 (1 use Homebrew)\r\n\r\nResult\r\n  - A person's account ('admin') owns /opt/homebrew. Other users get 'not writable' errors.\r\n\r\nName for the hidden Homebrew account [homebrew]: "]
